{# roomhive/admin/_macros.html.twig
   Shared admin macros — icon, empty_state, list_image.
   Imported by every admin/host template via:
     {% import 'admin/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}
   Then called as: {{ ui.icon('home') }}, {{ ui.empty_state('...') }}, etc.

   === OFFICIAL LUCIDE ICONS (this version) ===
   Every icon below uses the EXACT path data from lucide.dev
   (lucide-static, same SVGs the lucide.dev preview renders).
   stroke-width 2 = lucide.dev default. CSS rules still override
   wherever they exist.

   (Twig macros do NOT inherit through {% extends %} — shared
   macros must live in their own file and be imported where needed.)
#}
